column1:
@margosfantastic Don't get me wrong, I'm not saying you are disrespectful, but you responded to me defending your opinion and I honestly don't care lol. 
I just responded to that dude acting as if everyone must like Zhongli's the most.
People that are biased for him are like this towards people liking this trailer or just complimenting Mihoyo in the comment section. It's these Zhongli's c*ck suckers that are annoying and disrespectful.

@E not really if you've ever watched their Chinese trailer before.

Chinese zhongli sounds like an emperor who could destroy the entire world if he wants.
Meanwhile Chinese Baal is like a tryhard teenager lol.
